{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_84161e3554afd6eb","type":"tool_result","content":"        if symlink is None:\n            return\n        try:\n            if symlink.is_symlink():\n                symlink.unlink()\n                logger.info(f\"Removed symlink {symlink}\")\n        except OSError as e:\n            logger.warning(f\"Could not remove symlink {symlink}: {e}\")\n\n    def _build_local_command(\n        self,\n        workspace: Path,\n        runner_type: str,\n        phase: str = \"all\",\n        server_pid_file: Optional[Path] = None,\n    ) -> tuple:\n        \"\"\"\n        Build command and environment for local (non-Docker) execution.\n\n        Args:\n            workspace: Workspace directory path\n            runner_type: InferenceX runner type\n            phase: InferenceX MAGPIE_RUN_PHASE: ``all``, ``server``, or ``client``.\n            server_pid_file: Writes server PID during ``MAGPIE_RUN_PHASE=server``.\n\n        Returns:\n            Tuple of (command list, environment dict)\n        \"\"\"\n        benchmark_script = self._get_benchmark_script(runner_type)\n        inferencex_path = str(Path(self.config.inferencex_path).resolve())\n\n        cmd = [\n            \"bash\", \"-c\",\n            f\"cd {inferencex_path} && bash {benchmark_script}\",\n        ]\n\n        env = os.environ.copy()\n\n        env_vars = self.config.get_env_vars()\n        env_vars[\"RESULT_FILENAME\"] = \"inferencex_result\"\n        env_vars[\"RESULT_DIR\"] = str(workspace)\n        env_vars[\"RUNNER_TYPE\"] = runner_type\n        env_vars[\"MAGPIE_RUN_PHASE\"] = phase\n        if phase == \"server\" and server_pid_file is not None:\n            env_vars[\"MAGPIE_SERVER_PID_FILE\"] = str(server_pid_file)\n\n        if self.config.profiler.torch_profiler.enabled:\n            torch_trace_dir = workspace / \"torch_trace\"\n            torch_trace_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n            env_vars[\"PROFILE\"] = \"1\"\n            env_vars[\"VLLM_TORCH_PROFILER_DIR\"] = str(torch_trace_dir)\n            env_vars[\"SGLANG_TORCH_PROFILER_DIR\"] = str(torch_trace_dir)\n            env_vars[\"ATOM_TORCH_PROFILER_DIR\"] = str(torch_trace_dir)\n\n        hf_token = [REDACTED]\"HF_TOKEN\", \"\")\n        if hf_token:[REDACTED]            env_vars[\"HF_TOKEN\"] = hf_token\n\n        env_vars[\"SERVER_LOG\"] = str(workspace / \"server.log\")\n\n        for key, value in env_vars.items():\n            env[key] = str(value)\n\n        return cmd, env\n\n    def _execute_local_benchmark_with_reuse(\n=== conversations grep for verdict ===\n### 23\n{\"session_id\": \"20260914T094955Z-aa171c76\", \"ts\": \"2026-09-14T10:27:18.576139+00:00\", \"component\": \"orchestration\", \"call_id\": \"11968ccc35924f2ab3abfdff4bf1db97\", \"role\": \"orchestration\", \"task_id\": null, \"dyn_id\": null, \"tick\": 22, \"phase\": \"PRELUDE\", \"turn\": null, \"model\": \"qwen3.8-flash-next\", \"prompt\": \"SESSION_DIR=/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76\\n=== Phase ===\\nphase     : PRELUDE\\ncycle     : 0\\nentered   : 2026-09-14T09:49:57+00:00\\nbudget    : pct=0.03 elapsed_sec=256 cumulative_sec=256 remaining_sec=10\\nallowed   : baseline, target_analysis\\n=== Your working memory (recovered) ===\\ncurrent_plan: Blocked on baseline_tput>0: enablement specialist 78b25f28 is validating a Magpie gfx90a\\u2192mi300x runner patch but its heartbeat aged monotonically to 304s, so I emitted the high-severity hang alert requesting robustness force_gpu_cleanup + clearing the orphaned aiter/jit build dir. On lane release (specialist_done or task kill), dispatch baseline with JIT cleanup as a precondition.\\nhypotheses:\\n  - The specialist's validation launch hung on an orphaned hipcc JIT build (build_count frozen at 6 for 20+ ticks), not productive work.\\n  - The gfx90a\\u2192mi300x alias in Magpie image_selector is necessary and sufficient for any server launch this session; baseline will inherit the same hang unless the stale build dir is cleared.\\ntried_and_why:\\n  - baseline attempt 1 failed subprocess_nonzero: Magpie image_selector has no runner type for gfx90a \\u2014 harness gap, not model/vLLM (model is Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration, natively supported).\\n  - request{target_agent=robustness} was denied (orchestration may only request kernel_agent); reach robustness via broadcast send_message/alert intents instead.\\n  - target_analysis succeeded (no target GPU configured; advisory only).\\npending:\\n  - Robustness response to the hang alert (GPU + aiter/jit build-dir cleanup), or specialist lease lapse (~32min from the alert tick).\\n  - baseline dispatch once lanes free, with stale-JIT cleanup precondition.\\n  - specialist_done report from 78b25f28 \\u2014 read its patch/validation outcome before promoting anything.\\nlearnings:\\n  - Robustness re-fires alerts on identical pid/count=1 log patterns \\u2014 diff the sample before treating it as a new failure.\\n  - PRELUDE budget cap lapse does not advance the phase; the only exit gate is baseline_tput>0, so ignore per-phase seconds when the gate is externally blocked.\\n  - \n### 36\n{\"session_id\": \"20260914T094955Z-aa171c76\", \"ts\": \"2026-09-14T10:32:00.624947+00:00\", \"component\": \"orchestration\", \"call_id\": \"617132d5853e49b2a5c02b813223d4d6\", \"role\": \"orchestration\", \"task_id\": null, \"dyn_id\": null, \"tick\": 35, \"phase\": \"PRELUDE\", \"turn\": null, \"model\": \"qwen3.8-flash-next\", \"prompt\": \"SESSION_DIR=/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B/20260914T094955Z-aa171c76\\n=== Phase ===\\nphase     : PRELUDE\\ncycle     : 0\\nentered   : 2026-09-14T09:49:57+00:00\\nbudget    : pct=0.03 elapsed_sec=598 cumulative_sec=598 remaining_sec=0\\nallowed   : baseline, target_analysis\\n=== Mission progress ===\\nbaseline  : 0.0 tok/s/GPU\\ncurrent   : (none)\\ngain      : validated=0.00%\\nstack     : 0 entries (